[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Words Commonly Used With It\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<div class=\\\"center_text\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To talk or ask about recently finished events or actions with a connection to the present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">just<br/> only just<br/> recently</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Have the women <span class=\\\"strong\\\">just been left behind</span> to work the land?<br/> Or, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">have you only just started</span> to learn about Zambia now?<br/> What, you may ask, <span class=\\\"strong\\\">has the Zambian government done recently</span> to counteract Western influence?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"To talk or ask about experiences\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">ever</span> (in questions)</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"><span class=\\\"strong\\\">Have you ever been</span> to Zambia?</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have you ever been</span> to Zambia?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you <span class=\"strong\">travelled</span> through this large country that's about the size of Texas yet? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you <span class=\"strong\">noticed</span> that there are only 10 million people living there so far? "}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have</span> you <span class=\"strong\">discovered</span> that up to now the majority of Zambians still live in rural villages?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Or, <span class=\"strong\">have</span> you only just <span class=\"strong\">started</span> to learn about Zambia now?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What, you may ask, <span class=\"strong\">has</span> the Zambian government <span class=\"strong\"> done</span> recently to counteract Western influence?"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Have</span> the women just <span class=\"strong\">been</span> left behind to work the land?"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Go online or to the library to look up places to visit in Zambia."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Plan a trip deciding where to go and what to do."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write an email to a friend inviting them to go with you on the trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Explain the itinerary and why you have chosen those particular places."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read you email to a partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I find places to visit in Zambia."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I plan a trip giving reporting facts and actions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write an email inviting a friend to go on the trip."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I explain why I have chosen the places on the itinerary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I share my email with a partner."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Civilizations"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you want to talk about a civilization, you usually refer to a particular society in a particular place or at a particular time. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are different topics you can refer to, such as:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":1,\"columns\":1,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">people</span>: their nationality, their ethnicity, ancestry <br/> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">geography</span>: location, size, physical features, landscapes </br> <span class=\\\"strong\\\">culture</span>: languages spoken, art, music, dance, literature <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">religion</span>: beliefs<br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">housing</span>: materials used <br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">historical events </span><br/><span class=\\\"strong\\\">the government</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "The majority of Zambians still lives in rural villages."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Due to migration to urban areas, the number of farmers in Zambia has decreased."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Dance, accompanied by the drum, xylophone, or mbira, plays an important cultural role in Zambia."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Traditional ceremonies are held throughout the country during the year."}]}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome", "contents": [{}], "template_override": 1}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn10le05ob09re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn10le05ob09re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn10le05ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Have you ever been to Zambia? Have you travelled through this large country that's about the size of Texas yet? Have you noticed that there are only 10 million people living there so far? Have you discovered that up to now the majority of Zambians still live in rural villages?\nOr, have you only started to learn about Zambia now?<br/>Today, many Zambians live in urban areas. That is where the work being offered in services and factories can be found. In the north, the people being put under economic pressure as copper production lessens, need alternatives. The number of jobs being reduced changes lives. Families move to cities.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn10le05ob09re2img01.jpg"}, {"text": "Due to migration to urban areas, the number of farmers in Zambia has also grown smaller. This has resulted in a reduction in the crops being produced. Women, being left behind, work family farms but cannot grow as much on their own.<br/>Despite the hardships, life in Zambia is still good. People there take pleasure in the simple things, and there is an atmosphere of sharing and togetherness. Dance, accompanied by the drum, xylophone, or mbira , plays an important cultural role in Zambia. Dances being performed to celebrate personal milestones as well as major community and group events are common. The occasions are festive.", "id": 2, "time": "41000", "image": "engenn10le05ob09re2img02.jpg"}, {"text": "What, you may ask, has the Zambian government done recently to counteract Western influence? Well, institutions are being established to protect the country's culture and heritage and keep the old traditions alive. Visitors to Zambia today are encouraged to attend one of the over 20 annual traditional ceremonies being held throughout the country during the year.", "id": 3, "time": "82000", "image": "engenn10le05ob09re2img03.jpg"}]}}]}, {"id": 2, "type": "text", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "p", "value": "Zambian culture is a mixture of values, norms, material and spiritual traditions from more than 70 ethnic roots.  A few centuries ago, the majority of tribes migrated into the area. They grew in number and many traveled in search of new farmland and pastures."}]}], "exercises": [{"questions": [], "stimuli_ids": [0], "id": 0, "type": "WLC", "img_path": "", "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "Learning Outcomes", "content": " I can talk about different cultures, civilizations, and social issues."}, {"type": "Learning Outcomes", "con